{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 12814381051178126114,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 Exception Model",
      "source_hash": 15042191302891017838,
      "context_hash": 13425841733453885092,
      "translation": "ARM64 예외 모델",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141007Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Exception levels, interrupt handling, and the GIC",
      "source_hash": 8589018488625814554,
      "context_hash": 7594030479807635991,
      "translation": "예외 레벨, 인터럽트 처리, 그리고 GIC",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interrupt": "인터럽트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141008Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Exception Levels",
      "source_hash": 7250020862021993387,
      "context_hash": 4863321575164469488,
      "translation": "예외 레벨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141008Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM64 defines four exception levels (EL0-EL3), roughly analogous to x86 protection rings but more hierarchical:",
      "source_hash": 2417096333965912701,
      "context_hash": 15741440544377443869,
      "translation": "ARM64는 네 가지 예외 레벨(EL0-EL3)을 정의하며, 이는 x86 보호 링과 대략 유사하지만 더 계층적입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141008Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Key properties:",
      "source_hash": 5409981686824485612,
      "context_hash": 3609321095770451093,
      "translation": "주요 특성:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141008Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**EL0**: unprivileged, can only access user-accessible system registers",
      "source_hash": 9717797064303987635,
      "context_hash": 7587326315957262784,
      "translation": "**EL0**: 비특권 레벨이며, 사용자가 접근할 수 있는 시스템 레지스터에만 접근 가능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141009Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**EL1**: kernel mode, full access to kernel address space and EL1 system registers",
      "source_hash": 398281014709355437,
      "context_hash": 354800758605707285,
      "translation": "**EL1**: 커널 모드이며, 커널 주소 공간과 EL1 시스템 레지스터에 대한 전체 접근 가능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "address space": "주소 공간",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "kernel address": "커널 주소"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141009Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**EL2**: hypervisor mode, can trap and emulate EL1 operations",
      "source_hash": 10596726856262773443,
      "context_hash": 613709179425472304,
      "translation": "**EL2**: 하이퍼바이저 모드이며, EL1 동작을 트랩하고 에뮬레이션 가능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hypervisor": "하이퍼바이저"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141009Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**EL3**: most privileged, manages secure/non-secure world transitions (TrustZone)",
      "source_hash": 3544401754104799779,
      "context_hash": 15195405425416780375,
      "translation": "**EL3**: 최고 특권 레벨이며, secure/non-secure 월드 전환을 관리(TrustZone)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141009Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The Linux kernel runs at EL1 normally, but with VHE (Virtualization Host Extension, ARMv8.1+) KVM runs the host kernel at EL2 directly (EL2 registers are made to look like EL1 registers via VHE).",
      "source_hash": 4972533271499840823,
      "context_hash": 9357394945450604065,
      "translation": "Linux 커널은 일반적으로 EL1에서 실행되지만, VHE(Virtualization Host Extension, 가상화 호스트 확장, ARMv8.1+)를 사용하면 KVM은 호스트 커널을 EL2에서 직접 실행합니다(VHE를 통해 EL2 레지스터가 EL1 레지스터처럼 보이게 됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "KVM": "KVM",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "host": "호스트",
        "virtualization": "가상화"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141010Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Without VHE, a small EL2 stub handles world-switching while the host kernel stays at EL1.",
      "source_hash": 1289510521467531049,
      "context_hash": 3892918368455533114,
      "translation": "VHE가 없으면 작은 EL2 스텁이 월드 전환(world-switching)을 처리하고, 호스트 커널은 EL1에 머무릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "host": "호스트",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141010Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:2",
      "source": "Guests always run at EL1/EL0.",
      "source_hash": 10484575577074180367,
      "context_hash": 10361313283362403130,
      "translation": "게스트는 항상 EL1/EL0에서 실행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "guest": "게스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141010Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
