    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Exception vectors: VBAR_EL1",
      "source_hash": 2790842786815725485,
      "context_hash": 5554483990241445527,
      "translation": "예외 벡터: VBAR_EL1",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When an exception occurs, the CPU jumps to an entry in the **vector table**, pointed to by `VBAR_EL1` (Vector Base Address Register for EL1):",
      "source_hash": 9076062849322726946,
      "context_hash": 6895335525246819904,
      "translation": "예외가 발생하면 CPU는 `VBAR_EL1`(Vector Base Address Register for EL1)이 가리키는 **벡터 테이블**의 엔트리로 점프합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux vector table",
      "source_hash": 5787482780999816262,
      "context_hash": 12057466509977632167,
      "translation": "Linux 벡터 테이블",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:58:24.141012Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Syndrome registers: ESR_EL1",
      "source_hash": 1715093406249571729,
      "context_hash": 47624263322867355,
      "translation": "신드롬 레지스터: ESR_EL1",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:48:58.029763Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a synchronous exception occurs, `ESR_EL1` (Exception Syndrome Register) identifies the cause:",
      "source_hash": 5036908975360553696,
      "context_hash": 3484458029037100035,
      "translation": "동기 예외가 발생하면 `ESR_EL1`(Exception Syndrome Register)이 그 원인을 식별합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:48:58.029764Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Fault status codes (DFSC)",
      "source_hash": 11538675885598221002,
      "context_hash": 7963675662641037495,
